From dc5c2455257ff007639b4cbcbc0c714f81c5ef42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:22:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(update): cross-process admission fence [daveey] (#98)

* feat(update): fence Desktop reservations and Kanban claims across processes [daveey]

* test(update): retain spawned lock-holder synchronization event [daveey]

* fix(admission): retain turn handoffs and avoid global lock waits [daveey]

* fix(admission): isolate stale handoffs and retry queued prompts [daveey]

* fix(admission): guard refused worker cleanup by turn ownership [daveey]

* fix(admission): preserve generation across nested prompt dispatch [daveey]

* fix(admission): notification claims adopt their own turn generation [daveey]

* fix(admission): settle clears turn generation so later direct turns own the session [daveey]

* test(admission): rebind split prompt submit helpers [daveey]

* [daveey] Admission fence: settled turns still own their own unwinding (fixes running left True after mid-turn settle)

* test(tui): ephemeral profile-override tests use a real temp profile home for the update fence [daveey]

* test(tui): pin mid-turn settle leaves running False after worker exit [daveey]

---------

Co-authored-by: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
